{"3834880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tales of Justice Academy: Winds Arise", "steam_appid": 3834880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4324390], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-rich RPG, you play as a young martial artist who, by chance, finds himself enrolled in the prestigious Mingjing Academy — a school famed for cultivating future legends of the martial world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is more than just a place of study.<br>It’s a crossroads of rival powers, tangled politics, and secrets from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Court intrigue, factional strife, remnants of a fallen cult...<br>In this world of shifting alliances, the line between good and evil is never clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through quiet days and turbulent events, you'll meet colorful characters, uncover hidden truths, and carve your own path in a living, breathing wuxia world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With immersive storytelling, rich character interactions, open-ended development, and a unique combat technique system, step into a sprawling martial epic like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎ A Massive Story to Uncover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500,000 words of original narrative and 30+ hand-drawn CGs.<br>Tons of side quests and bonus content deepen your journey through the martial world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings await — will you become the “Master Healer,” the “Wanderer,” the “Jack-of-All-Trades,” or unite the land under your banner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/431bd77cf7a773b04b99ad57b8cbb3c7.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=1600 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/431bd77cf7a773b04b99ad57b8cbb3c7.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/431bd77cf7a773b04b99ad57b8cbb3c7.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎ Build Your Character, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your martial skills on the field, study ancient texts in class, and rise to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 12 development paths, live a balanced academic life of both mind and body, and shape your own martial identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow herbs, cook meals, grill over an open fire, go hunting, play strategy games, take on bounty quests — the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/28a2830a8e2a6e72be8a7dec9b196e81.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=1600 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/28a2830a8e2a6e72be8a7dec9b196e81.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/28a2830a8e2a6e72be8a7dec9b196e81.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based battles enhanced with a unique <strong>Technique Stage</strong> and <strong>Technique Branching</strong> system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match over 100 martial arts techniques and inner styles to create your own signature fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master timing, adapt to the flow of battle, and unleash devastating combos in one fluid strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/29623259260a7cd01ccb7f359daf8311.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=1600 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/29623259260a7cd01ccb7f359daf8311.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/29623259260a7cd01ccb7f359daf8311.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎ Forge Bonds in the Martial World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 8 distinct characters, each with their own backgrounds, personalities, and stories — including 3 romance options and 2 potential party members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From busy market streets to quiet teahouses, your relationships will grow through shared encounters and heartfelt conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your bond with each character to unlock unique storylines, exclusive CGs, and meaningful choices that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/abec93e8384769394822355733cf9f89.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/abec93e8384769394822355733cf9f89.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/abec93e8384769394822355733cf9f89.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Character Profiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/4d540af3be02733a98622852a8d2f952.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A native of Kaifeng, raised in a decent household (with branching options during character creation).<br>Calm, responsible, and quietly drawn to the world of martial heroes.<br>Not born to be a legend — but determined to walk the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/387aa556faf22d4ced27b2321cb5b3e2.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sang Ling'er</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful girl from the Miao tribe of Yunling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known for her mountain songs and riddles, she commands twin snakes with the bells she wears, and is skilled in poison and medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She leaves her village in search of the truth behind a certain event. After solving a poisoning case, she’s discovered by the academy and granted the chance to take the entrance exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/ac268e286804278d347d2ca170492595.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wenren Yao</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owner of the Fan Pavilion, warm and wise, always seen with her round fan.<br>As the eldest daughter of the Wenren family, she’s managed the family business since youth.<br>Her eyes light up when she sees account books. In her free time, she enjoys reading storybooks and trying her hand at cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/8839714ba1a740b2a85adf9360317ded.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duan Hongtang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daughter of the Xuan Dao Sect leader. Wields ring blades with grace.<br>Gentle in appearance but strong-willed and fiercely loyal.<br>Raised to uphold the image of a sect leader’s daughter, she maintains elegance and composure — though she secretly longs to explore the world beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/bea34e4b040f2c09262faac383d05b85.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shen Tinglan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disciple of Sword Hearth Sect, a young senior sister of her generation, and a skilled Sword wielder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and composed, humble and courteous to all, she is already one of the finest heroines in the jianghu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you be fortunate enough to see her draw her blade, you will understand that “Little Senior Sister” has never been merely a respectful title among fellow disciples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/8f59e1b8ace20a9cc861bc4de202e2e2.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ye Luo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hailing from the royal court, already trusted to carry out missions outside the palace at a young age.<br>Efficient, quiet, and emotionally reserved — but never lacking in ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/3b34be32d20954e98ac17839b2e14730.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fang Yuchi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Son of a local magistrate from a scholarly family. <br>Strong-willed and sharp-eyed, with a passion for law since childhood.<br>She’s devoured every legal text in her home library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/5eac602beafddfbbd3701bc6fa95a542.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deng Xiaoyu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young disciple of the Lantern Shadow Pavilion.<br>Skilled beyond his years, but blunt and outspoken — often leading to minor “misunderstandings.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/b4444f825b8040f7383cd550de9494aa.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huiguang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright, witty disciple of Xiangguo Temple.<br>Polite and always smiling, with a silver tongue that persuades even the most frugal to offer incense.<br>He serves as the temple’s charming public face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/5c507fcfaed54d6270ad0f6f86f6f144.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhe Guanshan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial arts instructor at Mingjing Academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm and disciplined, with the air of a seasoned veteran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though strict in training, he’s known for his bold spirit and generosity — and is beloved by generations of students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this story-rich RPG, you play as a young martial artist who, by chance, finds himself enrolled in the prestigious Mingjing Academy — a school famed for cultivating future legends of the martial world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this is more than just a place of study.<br>It’s a crossroads of rival powers, tangled politics, and secrets from the past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Court intrigue, factional strife, remnants of a fallen cult...<br>In this world of shifting alliances, the line between good and evil is never clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through quiet days and turbulent events, you'll meet colorful characters, uncover hidden truths, and carve your own path in a living, breathing wuxia world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With immersive storytelling, rich character interactions, open-ended development, and a unique combat technique system, step into a sprawling martial epic like no other.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Key Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎ A Massive Story to Uncover</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 500,000 words of original narrative and 30+ hand-drawn CGs.<br>Tons of side quests and bonus content deepen your journey through the martial world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings await — will you become the “Master Healer,” the “Wanderer,” the “Jack-of-All-Trades,” or unite the land under your banner?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/431bd77cf7a773b04b99ad57b8cbb3c7.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=1600 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/431bd77cf7a773b04b99ad57b8cbb3c7.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/431bd77cf7a773b04b99ad57b8cbb3c7.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎ Build Your Character, Your Way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your martial skills on the field, study ancient texts in class, and rise to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 12 development paths, live a balanced academic life of both mind and body, and shape your own martial identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow herbs, cook meals, grill over an open fire, go hunting, play strategy games, take on bounty quests — the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/28a2830a8e2a6e72be8a7dec9b196e81.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=1600 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/28a2830a8e2a6e72be8a7dec9b196e81.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/28a2830a8e2a6e72be8a7dec9b196e81.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎Turn-Based Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic turn-based battles enhanced with a unique <strong>Technique Stage</strong> and <strong>Technique Branching</strong> system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mix and match over 100 martial arts techniques and inner styles to create your own signature fighting style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master timing, adapt to the flow of battle, and unleash devastating combos in one fluid strike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/29623259260a7cd01ccb7f359daf8311.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=1600 height=680 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/29623259260a7cd01ccb7f359daf8311.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/29623259260a7cd01ccb7f359daf8311.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◎ Forge Bonds in the Martial World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet 8 distinct characters, each with their own backgrounds, personalities, and stories — including 3 romance options and 2 potential party members.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From busy market streets to quiet teahouses, your relationships will grow through shared encounters and heartfelt conversations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raise your bond with each character to unlock unique storylines, exclusive CGs, and meaningful choices that shape your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/abec93e8384769394822355733cf9f89.poster.avif?t=1787589274\" width=800 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/abec93e8384769394822355733cf9f89.webm?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/abec93e8384769394822355733cf9f89.mp4?t=1787589274\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >◆ Character Profiles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/4d540af3be02733a98622852a8d2f952.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A native of Kaifeng, raised in a decent household (with branching options during character creation).<br>Calm, responsible, and quietly drawn to the world of martial heroes.<br>Not born to be a legend — but determined to walk the path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/387aa556faf22d4ced27b2321cb5b3e2.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sang Ling'er</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cheerful girl from the Miao tribe of Yunling.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Known for her mountain songs and riddles, she commands twin snakes with the bells she wears, and is skilled in poison and medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She leaves her village in search of the truth behind a certain event. After solving a poisoning case, she’s discovered by the academy and granted the chance to take the entrance exam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/ac268e286804278d347d2ca170492595.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wenren Yao</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Owner of the Fan Pavilion, warm and wise, always seen with her round fan.<br>As the eldest daughter of the Wenren family, she’s managed the family business since youth.<br>Her eyes light up when she sees account books. In her free time, she enjoys reading storybooks and trying her hand at cooking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/8839714ba1a740b2a85adf9360317ded.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Duan Hongtang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daughter of the Xuan Dao Sect leader. Wields ring blades with grace.<br>Gentle in appearance but strong-willed and fiercely loyal.<br>Raised to uphold the image of a sect leader’s daughter, she maintains elegance and composure — though she secretly longs to explore the world beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/bea34e4b040f2c09262faac383d05b85.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shen Tinglan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A disciple of Sword Hearth Sect, a young senior sister of her generation, and a skilled Sword wielder.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle and composed, humble and courteous to all, she is already one of the finest heroines in the jianghu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Should you be fortunate enough to see her draw her blade, you will understand that “Little Senior Sister” has never been merely a respectful title among fellow disciples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/8f59e1b8ace20a9cc861bc4de202e2e2.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ye Luo</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hailing from the royal court, already trusted to carry out missions outside the palace at a young age.<br>Efficient, quiet, and emotionally reserved — but never lacking in ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/3b34be32d20954e98ac17839b2e14730.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fang Yuchi</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Son of a local magistrate from a scholarly family. <br>Strong-willed and sharp-eyed, with a passion for law since childhood.<br>She’s devoured every legal text in her home library.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/5eac602beafddfbbd3701bc6fa95a542.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deng Xiaoyu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young disciple of the Lantern Shadow Pavilion.<br>Skilled beyond his years, but blunt and outspoken — often leading to minor “misunderstandings.”</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/b4444f825b8040f7383cd550de9494aa.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Huiguang</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bright, witty disciple of Xiangguo Temple.<br>Polite and always smiling, with a silver tongue that persuades even the most frugal to offer incense.<br>He serves as the temple’s charming public face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3834880/extras/5c507fcfaed54d6270ad0f6f86f6f144.avif?t=1787589274\" width=616 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zhe Guanshan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martial arts instructor at Mingjing Academy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Calm and disciplined, with the air of a seasoned veteran.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though strict in training, he’s known for his bold spirit and generosity — and is beloved by generations of students.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong></p>", "short_description": "You can play as a young martial artist entering Justice Academy. Train through various courses, customize your build with different weapons, 